; error: 12:12: 'c.n' is part of the place given as the value it is called on too, and the call changes it through 'x'; a place the call changes is given once, so keep a copy of it in a variable first, and give that as the other
shape Counter
    n: int = 0

    alters give(flex& x: int)
        x = .n
    fi
fi

task main()
    flex c = Counter {}
    c.give(&c.n)
fi
